{"id": "34450", "title": "无敌小后娘", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 49, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34450.htm", "intro": "无情已经是第Ｎ次被她的烂父亲卖入青楼了，不过没关系，她有脚可以自己逃走嘛！这里的路她都很熟的说～～只不过这次逃到半途中，竟然捡到一个坏脾气的小女娃？！小女娃脾气这么坏，不好好调教一下怎么行？所以她当然得凶凶她罗！哪知她才凶小女娃几句，众人便感动得奉她为上宾，迎到柳园去当有史以来最高价请来的丫鬟。当丫鬟也是很不赖的啦，但遇上爱找碴的男主人就很头痛了！天可明鉴，她是来当小女娃的丫鬟，又不是来抢当她的后娘，她对他绝对没有任何意图喔！所以，可不可以请他不要一天到晚「欺负」她呀～～", "base": "files/article/html/34/34450", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2186631.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2186632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2186633.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2186634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2186635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2186636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2186637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2186638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2186639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2186640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2186641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2186642.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2186643.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2186644.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2186645.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2186646.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2186647.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2186648.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2186649.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2186650.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2186651.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2186652.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2186653.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2186654.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "fil